cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  หากนำข้อมูลนี้ไปใช้ กรุณาอ้างอิง thai-auto-data และกรมการขนส่งทางบก /
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and also credit the
  Department of Land Transport, Thailand.
type: dataset
title: "thai-auto-data: Thailand new vehicle registrations and car prices"
abstract: >-
  Monthly new-vehicle registration counts in Thailand (DLT categories RY1,
  RY2, RY3) by brand and model from January 2021, normalized with stable brand
  and model IDs, market, brand and model trend tables, and prices from
  official manufacturer websites.
authors:
